flowchart TB
  user[You]
  subgraph web["Web UIs (authelia role)"]
    traefik[Traefik] -->|forwardAuth,<br/>every request| portal[Authelia<br/>password + 2FA]
    traefik -->|Remote-User header,<br/>NetworkPolicy: Traefik only| grafana[Grafana]
    traefik --> app[Protected apps<br/>admins or app-&lt;name&gt;]
  end
  subgraph k8s["Kubernetes (k3s_oidc role)"]
    headlamp[Headlamp] -->|as the user| authn[API server<br/>trusts Authelia's ID tokens]
    kubectl[kubectl oidc-login] -->|as the user| authn
    authn --> rbac[RBAC<br/>group admins = cluster-admin]
  end
  user -->|browser| traefik
  user --> headlamp & kubectl
  portal -.->|OIDC ID token| headlamp & kubectl

  class user muted
  class traefik,app net
  class portal,authn sec
  class rbac gov
  class grafana,headlamp obs
  class kubectl ci
  class web z-sec
  class k8s z-gov
